            </note>
            <note corresp="#d549-f2" n="5" xml:id="d549-f2-content">
                <p>Prominent Chinese political leader, appointed Minister of Agriculture and
                    Commerce on Jan. 12.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
